---
// CTA – ¿Listo para la aventura?
---

<section class="py-20 bg-accent relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <!-- Background decoration -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-accent-light/40"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-accent-dark/20"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/4 w-32 h-32 rounded-full bg-white/10 animate-float">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center relative z-10">
    <h2
      id="cta-heading"
      class="font-heading font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-primary-dark mb-4 reveal"
    >
      ¿Listo para la aventura?
    </h2>

    <p
      class="text-primary-dark/70 text-lg font-body max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 reveal reveal-delay-1"
    >
      Reserva ahora y vive una experiencia inolvidable en el corazón de la naturaleza
      colombiana.
    </p>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center mb-6 reveal reveal-delay-2"
    >
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/573228837910?text=Hola!%20Quiero%20reservar%20un%20plan%20en%20Horse%20Payo"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        onclick="fbq('track', 'Contact', {content_name: 'CTA Section', content_category: 'contact', currency: 'COP'})"
        class="bg-primary-dark text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 shadow-xl text-lg"
      >
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
          <path
            d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        Reservar por WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>

    <p
      class="text-primary-dark/50 text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 reveal reveal-delay-3"
    >
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
      </svg>
      Cupos limitados · Reserva con anticipación
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
